141
00:10:40,152 --> 00:10:41,794
[SPEAKER_00]: I stayed there until July.

142
00:10:42,714 --> 00:10:45,797
[SPEAKER_00]: And then I went over to Shreveport in the Texas League.

143
00:10:46,797 --> 00:10:49,720
[SPEAKER_00]: I finished 27 there and played there in 28.

144
00:10:49,780 --> 00:10:52,161
[SPEAKER_00]: That was a good year, 28.

145
00:10:52,382 --> 00:10:56,805
[SPEAKER_00]: And went on back to Detroit for spring training next year.

146
00:10:58,126 --> 00:11:04,771
[SPEAKER_00]: And at the close of spring training, just prior to opening the season, Bucky Harris was our manager.

147
00:11:05,408 --> 00:11:08,691
